msgctxt "Addon Summary"
msgid ""
msgstr "Automated library maintenance: scraping, refresh, cleaning, texture cache, backup, and network sync."

msgctxt "Addon Description"
msgid ""
msgstr "PowerToys automates Kodi library maintenance. Scrapes new content from configured source folders, periodically refreshes metadata (optionally only items missing artwork or with blank plot/MPAA), removes missing files and duplicate library entries (quality-weighted, IMDb-aware), prunes orphaned texture cache artwork and re-caches missing thumbnails, backs up the library on a schedule, and syncs UI refresh across network peers. Context menu actions provide on-demand clean, scan, and a library health report. All destructive operations honor Dry Run; file deletion is a separate opt-in."

msgctxt "Addon Disclaimer"
msgid ""
msgstr "Use at your own risk. Dry Run is enabled by default."

